#ASSERT `sch 1B para 9(2) the person may apply for an order under sub-paragraph (1)` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1B para 9(3) the court may make such further order relating to the sale or transfer of the interest as it thinks fit` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1B para 9(3) the court may make such further order relating to the sale or transfer of the interest as it thinks fit` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
