#ASSERT `sch 1B para 14A(3) the penalty for an offence under paragraph 14A` `on summary conviction in Scotland` EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF `on summary conviction in Scotland`, NOTHING, JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 5 1), NOTHING, FALSE)
